msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Not at all, Pauline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Вовсе нет, Паулина."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2682348B_8FC0_4FF9_80B2_87240AE45927
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
