#: scenario2:scenario2_B841D199_8B53_48BA_8AC6_A3C36B2158D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de92d8ecd0c2ba6c557717cf92d4079d9856460c0f99f005fb23d38b241500c0
