"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re the only one...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫who can put me in such high spirits with a "
"few simple words...⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
